  "details": "<p>This mountain is probably located in the Bolkar Mountains. A Mount Muti is mentioned in a Luwian <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felsinschrift_von_Bulgarmaden\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">rock inscription</a> at Bulgarmaden and that mountain might be identical to the Mount Mul\u00ee mentioned in the inscriptions of the Assyrian king Shalmaneser III (r. 858-824 BC).</p>",
